WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:12.259 --> 00:00:16.400
The upcoming Game of Thrones prequel series,
House of the Dragon, is based on the George

00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:21.840
RR Martin's Targaryen history book Fire &amp; Blood.
House of the Dragon is a Game of Thrones prequel

00:00:21.840 --> 00:00:26.099
show that is confirmed by HBO’s president
to air in 2022.

00:00:26.099 --> 00:00:31.529
Miguel Sapochnik and Ryan Condal will serve
as showrunners and executive producers. George

00:00:31.529 --> 00:00:34.149
R. R. Martin will also serve as executive
producer.

00:00:34.149 --> 00:00:40.690
It is based on George RR Martin’s book Fire
And Blood volume 1 and on Martin’s yet unfinished

00:00:40.690 --> 00:00:44.240
Fire And Blood volume 2 book.
“Fire &amp; Blood begins their tale with the

00:00:44.240 --> 00:00:49.110
legendary Aegon the Conqueror, creator of
the Iron Throne, and goes on to recount the

00:00:49.110 --> 00:00:53.859
generations of Targaryens who fought to hold
that iconic seat, all the way up to the civil

00:00:53.859 --> 00:00:58.739
war that nearly tore their dynasty apart.”
In other words, it covers events from Aegon's

00:00:58.739 --> 00:01:03.000
Conquest to the Dance of the Dragons.
That's Fire And Blood volume 1.

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:08.450
The yet unreleased Fire And Blood volume 2
will continue from where part 1 ended, with

00:01:08.450 --> 00:01:14.330
Rhaenyra Targaryen's son Aegon lll's reign
and will cover Blackyre rebellions, war with

00:01:14.330 --> 00:01:19.580
Dorne and go all the way to the Mad King and
Robert's Rebellion that ended Targaryen dynasty.

00:01:19.580 --> 00:01:23.540
But back to Aegon's Conquest.
As Arya Stark reminded Tywin Lannister in

00:01:23.540 --> 00:01:27.900
season 2 of Game of Thrones,
Aegon was not the only one riding a dragon

00:01:27.900 --> 00:01:31.690
during his Conquest.
''It wasn't just Aegon riding his dragon,

00:01:31.690 --> 00:01:37.020
it was Rhaenys and Visenya, too...
Rhaenys rode Meraxes, Visenya rode Vhagar...

00:01:37.020 --> 00:01:41.680
Visenya Targaryen was a great warrior.
She had a Valyrian steel sword she called

00:01:41.680 --> 00:01:45.030
'Dark Sister'."
Arya also revealed to Tywin that Visenya was

00:01:45.030 --> 00:01:48.820
a heroine of hers.
Queen Visenya Targaryen was the older sister

00:01:48.820 --> 00:01:53.300
and wife of Aegon the Conqueror,
the first Lord of the Seven Kingdoms. Her

00:01:53.300 --> 00:01:58.730
younger sister, Rhaenys, was married to Aegon
as well. Visenya was a dragonrider, and rode

00:01:58.730 --> 00:02:02.840
the dragon Vhagar.
Like her siblings, Visenya possessed the classical

00:02:02.840 --> 00:02:08.700
Valyrian features: long, silver-gold hair,
which she often braided or bound up in rings,

00:02:08.700 --> 00:02:12.849
and purple eyes.
Hers was a harsher beauty than her sister,

00:02:12.849 --> 00:02:19.250
Rhaenys. Sensual and passionate woman,
Visenya was also stern, serious, and unforgiving.

00:02:19.250 --> 00:02:24.170
Some claimed that Visenya dabbled in dark
sorceries and played with poisons.

00:02:24.170 --> 00:02:29.760
Visenya was both a dragonrider and a warrior,
comfortable in both silk and in ringmail.

00:02:29.760 --> 00:02:35.610
When garbed as a warrior, she always wielded
the Valyrian steel longsword Dark Sister.

00:02:35.610 --> 00:02:40.740
Visenya was the mother of infamous Maegor
Targaryen, known as Maegor the Cruel,

00:02:40.740 --> 00:02:44.230
the third King of the Seven Kingdoms, but
he died without issue,

00:02:44.230 --> 00:02:49.109
so all of the subsequent Targaryen rulers
(including Daenerys Targaryen)

00:02:49.109 --> 00:02:54.319
claim their descent from Visenya's sister,
Rhaenys. But let's start from the very beginning.

00:02:54.319 --> 00:02:59.099
Born on the island Dragonstone, Visenya was
the eldest child of Lord Aerion Targaryen

00:02:59.099 --> 00:03:04.269
and Lady Valaena Velaryon. Her two younger
siblings, Aegon and Rhaenys, were born within

00:03:04.269 --> 00:03:10.370
a few years following her birth. Since young
age, Visenya trained together with Aegon at

00:03:10.370 --> 00:03:13.969
arms,
and she became a skilled warrior. As expected,

00:03:13.969 --> 00:03:19.061
Visenya was wed to her brother Aegon
following Valyrian custom. However, Aegon

00:03:19.061 --> 00:03:24.030
took their younger sister as a wife as well.
People claimed that he had wed Visenya out

00:03:24.030 --> 00:03:29.939
of duty, and Rhaenys out of desire.
Prior to her wedding, Visenya became a dragonrider,

00:03:29.939 --> 00:03:34.319
having bonded with the dragon Vhagar.
When Aegon's Conquest of the Seven Kingdoms

00:03:34.319 --> 00:03:39.469
began, Visenya sailed with her siblings from
Dragonstone. While Aegon began construction

00:03:39.469 --> 00:03:46.310
of the Aegonfort, Visenya subdued House Stokeworth
by setting ablaze the roofs of Stokeworth.

00:03:46.310 --> 00:03:49.650
After the defeat of House Darklyn in Aegon's
first test,

00:03:49.650 --> 00:03:55.040
Visenya claimed the riches of Duskendale,
swelling the coffers of House Targaryen.

00:03:55.040 --> 00:03:58.999
Having conquered a dozen houses and secured
the mouth of the Blackwater,

00:03:58.999 --> 00:04:02.700
Aegon was crowned king at the Aegonfort. Visenya,
now a queen,

00:04:02.700 --> 00:04:05.109
placed a Valyrian steel circlet on Aegon's
head

00:04:05.109 --> 00:04:10.180
while their sister Rhaenys hailed him as the
new King of All Westeros.

00:04:10.180 --> 00:04:14.709
Following the coronation, Visenya accompanied
the Targaryen fleet to Gulltown and the Vale

00:04:14.709 --> 00:04:20.169
of Arryn. When the Arryn fleet sunk a third
of Targaryen ships and captured many more

00:04:20.169 --> 00:04:25.700
in a battle in the waters off Gulltown, Visenya
descended from the sky upon Vhagar, burning

00:04:25.700 --> 00:04:29.230
their ships.
Next, Visenya was sent to Crackclaw Point

00:04:29.230 --> 00:04:32.790
by Aegon.
The local lords had learned of the death of

00:04:32.790 --> 00:04:35.890
Harren Hoare,
King of the Isles and the Rivers, at the burning

00:04:35.890 --> 00:04:40.220
of Harrenhal by Aegon,
so the Crackclaws submitted quickly to Visenya,

00:04:40.220 --> 00:04:43.890
swearing oaths of fealty.
Visenya took them as her own men,

00:04:43.890 --> 00:04:49.120
and from that day forth the lords owed their
loyalty directly to the Iron Throne.

00:04:49.120 --> 00:04:54.400
Visenya met Rhaenys, Aegon, and the Targaryen
host at Stoney Sept, from where they raced

00:04:54.400 --> 00:04:59.810
south. There, they met the combined hosts
of the Reach and the westerlands in battle.

00:04:59.810 --> 00:05:05.260
Visenya and her siblings fought from dragonback,
setting dry grasses and stands of wheat on

00:05:05.260 --> 00:05:09.190
the battlefield afire.
With more than four thousand men dead from

00:05:09.190 --> 00:05:13.620
the fire, and tens of thousands wounded by
the flames, the battle became known as the

00:05:13.620 --> 00:05:17.630
Field of Fire. Mern IX Gardener, King of the
Reach,

00:05:17.630 --> 00:05:22.910
died in battle while Loren I Lannister, King
of the Rock fled and bent the knee,

00:05:22.910 --> 00:05:25.980
giving Targaryens the victory. According to
legend,

00:05:25.980 --> 00:05:30.190
Visenya thanked the gods that Loren had ridden
forth to face the Targaryens

00:05:30.190 --> 00:05:34.850
when she saw Casterly Rock, as she believed
that dragon flame would not have been able

00:05:34.850 --> 00:05:39.210
to dishearten the Lannister king if he had
remained inside the Rock.

00:05:39.210 --> 00:05:44.820
Visenya had taken an arrow in the shoulder
during the Field of Fire, but soon recovered.

00:05:44.820 --> 00:05:48.880
Following the surrender of King Loren, the
three Targaryen siblings parted ways once

00:05:48.880 --> 00:05:51.780
more,
but met soon again at the banks of the Trident,

00:05:51.780 --> 00:05:57.270
where they awaited the host of Torrhen Stark,
King in the North. After Torrhen bent the

00:05:57.270 --> 00:06:01.440
knee, Visenya parted from her siblings and
returned to the Vale, where House Arryn had

00:06:01.440 --> 00:06:06.340
strengthened their defenses.
A strong host had been positioned at the Bloody

00:06:06.340 --> 00:06:09.930
Gate.
However, Visenya bypassed these hosts by flying

00:06:09.930 --> 00:06:14.720
up to the Eyrie upon Vhagar's back.
She landed in the courtyard, where she was

00:06:14.720 --> 00:06:19.140
met by Ronnel Arryn,
the young King of Mountain and Vale.

00:06:19.140 --> 00:06:23.750
Ronnel's regent and mother, Lady Sharra Arryn,
surrendered the Eyrie to Visenya.

00:06:23.750 --> 00:06:27.340
Visenya fought alongside her siblings in the
First Dornish War,

00:06:27.340 --> 00:06:34.060
which lasted from 4 AC to 13 AC. After Rhaenys
died in Dorne in 10 AC, Visenya and Aegon,

00:06:34.060 --> 00:06:39.580
grief-stricken at her death, set every castle,
keep, and holdfast in Dorne ablaze at least

00:06:39.580 --> 00:06:42.310
once,
with the exception of Sunspear.

00:06:42.310 --> 00:06:46.030
They also placed bounties on the heads of
the Dornish lords.

00:06:46.030 --> 00:06:49.770
Although half a dozen and more of those lords
were killed by assassins,

00:06:49.770 --> 00:06:53.060
only two of the killers lived to collect their
reward.

00:06:53.060 --> 00:06:57.170
In retaliation, the Dornish lords hired catspaws
themselves.

00:06:57.170 --> 00:07:00.540
Visenya and her escort were once attacked
in King's Landing,

00:07:00.540 --> 00:07:05.400
and she cut the last would-be assassin down
herself with Dark Sister.

00:07:05.400 --> 00:07:10.470
Visenya also single-handedly saved her brother,
husband and king Aegon from assassins.

00:07:10.470 --> 00:07:15.390
When the Conqueror argued that his guards
were still sufficient for his protection,

00:07:15.390 --> 00:07:21.680
Visenya drew Dark Sister. Before his guards
could react, she had cut Aegon's cheek,

00:07:21.680 --> 00:07:26.710
pointing out to him that his guards were slow
and lazy. This event led to the birth of the

00:07:26.710 --> 00:07:32.000
Kingsguard. Visenya modeled the vows of the
Kingsguard upon the vows of the Night's Watch,

00:07:32.000 --> 00:07:37.080
and she selected the first seven members herself.
Rhaenys's death in Dorne in 10 AC shattered

00:07:37.080 --> 00:07:41.330
the health of her son Aenys,
and people began to doubt as to whether he

00:07:41.330 --> 00:07:44.340
would live.
As Visenya had not yet gotten pregnant by

00:07:44.340 --> 00:07:49.900
Aegon despite more than a decade of marriage,
some had come to believe that she was barren,

00:07:49.900 --> 00:07:54.720
and even went as far as to suggest to Aegon
that he should take a new wife. Although many

00:07:54.720 --> 00:07:59.110
young women were presented to Aegon,
he refused to voice his opinion on the matter.

00:07:59.110 --> 00:08:04.910
In 11 AC, Visenya announced she was pregnant
with a son, and the next year, she gave birth

00:08:04.910 --> 00:08:10.920
to Aegon's second son, Maegor on Dragonstone.
Visenya raised Maegor on Dragonstone, and

00:08:10.920 --> 00:08:17.300
gave him her Valyrian steel sword, Dark Sister,
as a nameday present when the boy turned thirteen.

00:08:17.300 --> 00:08:23.450
In 23 AC, Aenys's first child, Princess Rhaena,
was born. Shortly after Maegor turned twelve,

00:08:23.450 --> 00:08:28.450
Visenya proposed a betrothal between her son
Maegor and Rhaena, to settle the issue of

00:08:28.450 --> 00:08:33.830
the royal succession, as Rhaena's birth had
sparked discussion about who was next in line

00:08:33.830 --> 00:08:38.120
behind Aenys:
his own daughter, or his brother. However,

00:08:38.120 --> 00:08:41.590
this never happened.
Visenya's relationship with Aegon, which had

00:08:41.590 --> 00:08:47.950
never been a warm one, grew more distant.
When Aegon in 35 AC had the Aegonfort torn

00:08:47.950 --> 00:08:50.700
down so they could start building the Red
Keep,

00:08:50.700 --> 00:08:56.670
Visenya was left in charge of the construction.
In his histories, Archmaester Gyldayn states

00:08:56.670 --> 00:09:00.860
that it was suggested at court that Aegon
had left Visenya at King's Landing so that

00:09:00.860 --> 00:09:04.280
he would not have to endure her presence on
Dragonstone.

00:09:04.280 --> 00:09:07.370
When Aegon died, both Visenya and Maegor were
present

00:09:07.370 --> 00:09:11.460
as his body was cremated and Aenys I Targaryen
was crowned.

00:09:11.460 --> 00:09:16.610
Aenys gifted Maegor with Blackfyre saying
he was more fit to wield it.

00:09:16.610 --> 00:09:20.860
Visenya Targaryen voiced the opinion that
Aenys was unfit to rule,

00:09:20.860 --> 00:09:25.510
claiming that, by giving Blackfyre to Maegor,
Aenys had admitted that he lacked the strength

00:09:25.510 --> 00:09:29.130
to rule.
In 39 AC, Visenya's son Maegor shocked the

00:09:29.130 --> 00:09:34.800
realm by taking a second wife and married
Alys Harroway. The outrage that followed resulted

00:09:34.800 --> 00:09:39.570
in Maegor being sent into exile.
Visenya was present the next year at the wedding

00:09:39.570 --> 00:09:44.670
of King Aenys' children Princess Rhaena to
Prince Aegon. At the feast that followed the

00:09:44.670 --> 00:09:48.460
ceremony, King Aenys named Aegon Prince of
Dragonstone,

00:09:48.460 --> 00:09:53.710
the title which had previously belonged to
Maegor. Visenya left the feast in protest

00:09:53.710 --> 00:09:59.000
and returned to Dragonstone upon Vhagar. Singers
claim that the moon turned red as they passed

00:09:59.000 --> 00:10:02.440
it.
Rhaenys died in Dorne before the end of Aegon's

00:10:02.440 --> 00:10:05.020
reign,
and a few years after Aegon's death their

00:10:05.020 --> 00:10:10.020
bastard half-brother Orys died
after an attempted conquest of Dorne,

00:10:10.020 --> 00:10:15.630
meaning that Visenya was the last surviving
member of the Conquest-generation of Targaryens.

00:10:15.630 --> 00:10:19.600
She continued to exert political influence
during the reign of Aegon's successor,

00:10:19.600 --> 00:10:24.010
Rhaenys's son Aenys I - who proved to be a
weakling,

00:10:24.010 --> 00:10:28.330
and was totally overwhelmed when the Faith
Militant uprising broke out,

00:10:28.330 --> 00:10:33.020
and fled from King's Landing to Dragonstone.
The stress of the uprisings caused Aenys to

00:10:33.020 --> 00:10:36.680
fall gravely ill,
and Visenya was called in to try to heal him

00:10:36.680 --> 00:10:42.630
with her arcane knowledge of potions.
For a time, Aenys actually seemed to recover,

00:10:42.630 --> 00:10:47.920
but when news came that his son and daughter
were besieged at Crakehall, his health drastically

00:10:47.920 --> 00:10:52.550
worsened again.
Some suspect that Visenya poisoned her nephew,

00:10:52.550 --> 00:10:55.830
although others point out that he did seem
to be recovering.

00:10:55.830 --> 00:10:59.770
Even those who suspect she killed him debate
her motivations:

00:10:59.770 --> 00:11:03.550
some think it was a cynical power-grab for
her son Maegor,

00:11:03.550 --> 00:11:06.830
while others think she did it for the good
of the Targaryen dynasty,

00:11:06.830 --> 00:11:11.270
as Aenys had proved to be a failure and incapable
of resisting the Faith Militant.

00:11:11.270 --> 00:11:16.990
Within hours of Aenys's death, Visenya flew
to Pentos to retrieve Maegor from exile.

00:11:16.990 --> 00:11:22.100
They returned with Vhagar, Maegor riding his
father's dragon Balerion,

00:11:22.100 --> 00:11:27.690
and an army of several hundred sellswords.
Maegor then proclaimed himself a king ahead

00:11:27.690 --> 00:11:33.020
of Aenys's surviving sons and daughters,
usurping the throne, and proceeded to reclaim

00:11:33.020 --> 00:11:36.770
King's Landing.
Visenya accompanied him to King's Landing,

00:11:36.770 --> 00:11:41.520
where she challenged anyone who denied Maegor's
right to rule, which resulted in a trial of

00:11:41.520 --> 00:11:46.690
seven between Maegor and the Warrior's Sons.
Although severely injured, Maegor was the

00:11:46.690 --> 00:11:50.290
only survivor.
Visenya ultimately died late in Maegor the

00:11:50.290 --> 00:11:56.040
Cruel's reign from a sudden illness.
Maegor lost a key ally, and Vhagar was left

00:11:56.040 --> 00:11:59.770
riderless.
Not long afterward all the Great Houses finally

00:11:59.770 --> 00:12:04.839
turned against Maegor openly,
and he died on the Iron Throne itself. Visenya

00:12:04.839 --> 00:12:10.290
was cremated as per Targaryen custom.
Her bones and ashes were interred beside those

00:12:10.290 --> 00:12:16.480
of her brother-husband, King Aegon I Targaryen.
That's the story of Queen Visenya Targaryen,

00:12:16.480 --> 00:12:21.830
the warrior sister and wife of Aegon the Conqueror
with whom she had a son Maegor the Cruel.

00:12:21.830 --> 00:12:26.920
Along with her siblings, Visenya played a
key role in the Targaryen invasion of Westeros,

00:12:26.920 --> 00:12:30.870
her most notable action being the single-handed
conquest of the Vale of Arryn.

00:12:30.870 --> 00:12:33.910
Thank you so much for watching, I hope you
enjoyed this video and if you did please give

00:12:33.910 --> 00:12:35.810
it a big thumbs up and I hope to see you in
the next one. Peace!

